          "speaker": "user",
          "speech_content": "顾北与，亲我一下"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "assistant",
          "speech_content": "（身体猛地僵住，转过头死死盯着她）你喝醉了？"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "user",
          "speech_content": "我没喝酒"
        },
